    "title": "Is Lowe’s open on Easter 2026?",
    "text": "Easter, which falls on April 5, marks the official start of spring, and with that, spring cleaning and home improvement planning begins to prepare for the holiday and the new season.This is a time Lowe’s shoppers head to the store to find everything from patio furniture and tools to Easter decorations to enjoy the warm weather and deck out their home for the special day.But with it being a holiday, it might not be clear if you’ll be able to shop at Lowe’s the day of.So here’s what you need to know about Lowe’s store hours this Sunday.Is Lowe’s open on Easter Sunday 2026?No, Lowe’s will not be open on Easter 2026.However, you can visit the store before then on April 3 (Good Friday) or April 4 from 6 a.m. to 10 p.m. to make any last-minute purchases before the holiday.Lowe’s tends to close on Easter as well as the following holidays:If you’d like to stop at Lowe’s before Easter Sunday, you can find your local store here.Is Lowe’s having an Easter sale?Lowe’s isn’t holding an Easter sale specifically, but that doesn’t mean there are no sales available.You can visit before Sunday to shop the SpringFest sale now through April 22.The sale features major markdowns storewide, including on grilles, gardening supplies, patio furniture and appliances.If you’re planning to shop on Easter, the deals are available on Lowe’s website to check out here.Like Lowe’s, Costco will be closed, but you can still shop in-store at Walmart, which will be open on Sunday. You can also stop by Dunkin’ for you favorite coffee while running errands.More Easter 2026 Store HoursRead the original article on NJ.com. Add NJ.com as a Preferred Source by clicking here.",
